List of control lines:
----------------------
SUM - set ALU operation to addition/subtraction - otherwise it is bitwise AND
INB - invert B input
CIN - carry in
ALU - set accumulator input to ALU - otherwise it is from data bus
ACM - clock accumulator
TMP - clock temporary register (ALU B input)
INST - clock instruction register
INCPC - increment program counter
JMP - clock program counter (from multiplexer)
TMPADR - clock temporary address register
ADRMUX - set address multiplexer to temporary address register - otherwise it comes from program counter
LINK - clock link register (from program counter)
LINKMUX - set program counter multiplexer to link register - otherwise it comes from data bus
DOUT - write to memory
PAUSE - pause clock

